@startuml 27-c4-codigo
!pragma layout elk
!include estilo.iuml
title C4 nivel 4 — Código: del POST /api/ingest a la alerta

skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F7F9FC
  BorderColor #1B2A41
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4CC
  BorderColor #A08A1E
  FontSize 12
}

class "Dispositivo IoT\n(simulado)" as IOT <<externo>>

class "handle(request)" as Handler <<entry>> {
  <size:10>src/server/api/handlers.ts</size>
  + POST /api/ingest
  + POST /api/admin/simulate-alert
  + GET /api/alerts
}

class "**Telemetry**\n<size:10>domain/alerts.ts</size>" as Tel <<type>> {
  + vehicleId, ts, lat, lng
  + battery, speedKmh, helmetOn
  + impactG, gpsFixAgeMs, tripActive
}

class "**ALERT_THRESHOLDS**\n<size:10>domain/alerts.ts</size>" as Th <<const>> {
  criticalBattery = 15
  impactG = 3
  gpsFixAgeMs = 10000
}

class "**evaluateTelemetry(t)**\n<size:10>domain/alerts.ts</size>" as Eval <<function>> {
  prioridad: crash, sin casco,
  sin GPS, batería baja, ok
}

class "**TelemetryAlert**\n<size:10>unión de tipos</size>" as Ta <<type>> {
  ok · no-helmet · crash
  gps-lost · low-battery
}

class "**applyTelemetry(t, origin)**\n<size:10>services/fleet-sim.ts</size>" as Apply <<function>> {
  + evalúa, actualiza, emite
}

interface "**repos**\n<size:10>src/server/repositories.ts</size>" as Repos {
  + vehicles.byId(id)
  + vehicles.updateLive(id, lat, lng, battery, alert)
  + alerts.insert(row)
}

interface "**stream**\n<size:10>src/server/services/stream.ts</size>" as Stream {
  + emit(tipo, payload)
  + add(sub)
}

class "**alert_log**\n<size:10>db/schema.sql</size>" as Row <<table>> {
  id · vehicle_id · type
  lat · lng · at · origin
}

class "Navegador del operador\n(SSE)" as Op <<externo>>

IOT --> Handler : HTTPS POST /api/ingest
Handler --> Tel : valida y arma la muestra
Handler --> Apply : origin = "telemetry"
Apply --> Eval : evaluateTelemetry(t)
Eval --> Th : lee los umbrales
Eval ..> Ta : devuelve una alerta
Apply --> Repos : byId · updateLive · insert
Apply --> Stream : emit
Repos --> Row : SQL
Stream ..> Op : SSE position / alert

note bottom of Apply
  El botón del operador usa el MISMO camino:
  /api/admin/simulate-alert llama a
  applyTelemetry(t, "simulator").
  Una lectura sana NO borra una alerta activa.
end note

legend bottom
  Este nivel abre el componente "Alertas de flota" del diagrama 26.
  Nombres y reglas tomados del código real.
endlegend
@enduml
